                  <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl xl:text-[119px] leading-none tracking-tighter text-white animate-type">
             PHOTONIC CHIPS FOR AI
          </h1>
                          <p class="text-lg lg:text-[25px] lg:leading-[1.4] font-medium text-white max-w-[749px]">
            Photonic interconnects that scale AI supercomputers.
