                              </div>
                          <div class="p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col gap-4">
                                  <h3 class="text-xl lg:text-2xl font-medium leading-snug">Guide</h3>
                                                                  <div class="editor-content text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700"><p>Guide redefines how we build the light sources that power co-packaged optics (CPO). Hundreds of lasers and photonics components on a single chip.</p>
</div>
                                                  <p class="mt-auto">
