          <h2 class="heading-2">Passage M1000: Powering the Next 1000x in AI Performance</h2>
        </div>
                    <div class="col-span-6">
          <div class="body-2">
            <p>Explore the Passage M1000 Reference System, a groundbreaking platform built around the Passage M1000 3D Photonic Superchip. Discover how this revolutionary photonic interconnect technology is changing the game for Artificial Intelligence (AI) infrastructure by enabling massive scale-up bandwidth and radix, <wbr />connecting GPUs, TPUs and data center switches in the largest AI model training clusters.</p>

